    "project": "research/jv_scheme_stalk_audit_20261115/lean",
    "theorem": "JVSchemeStalkAudit.jv_scheme_stalk_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem jv_scheme_stalk_certificate : Nonempty (OriginLocalization ≃ₐ[A] OriginStalk) ∧ (∀ a : A, canonicalStalkEquiv a = actualGermMap a) ∧ Function.Bijective (algebraMap A OriginStalk) ∧ Module.length OriginStalk OriginStalk = 8 ∧ IsLocalRing OriginStalk ∧ Nonempty (ActualStalkResidue ≃+* F) ∧ ¬ AlgebraicGeometry.IsReduced coneScheme ∧ (∀ p : coneScheme, p = schemeOrigin) ∧ IsOpen ({schemeOrigin} : Set coneScheme) ∧ Nat.card coneScheme = 1 ∧ IsEmpty firstChartScheme ∧ IsEmpty firstOpenScheme ∧ Nonempty secondChartScheme ∧ Nonempty secondOpenScheme ∧ (firstBasicOpen : Set coneScheme) = ∅ ∧ (secondBasicOpen : Set secondConeScheme).Nonempty ∧ Module.length OriginStalk OriginStalk ≠ Nat.card coneScheme",
    "decl_sha256": "5f1d089fa3b6f010c51f4116714864ac15ade8c81061c64ca244732aa64dea06",
    "scope": "Actual affine scheme Spec(A), for the literal first JV homogeneous F101 quotient. Actual origin structure-sheaf stalk, official categorical and algebra stalk/prime-localization comparisons, actual canonical coefficient map equals actual global-section germ map, canonical map bijective, actual stalk own self-module length8/locality/canonical residue field F101. Actual nonreduced scheme and actual unique isolated origin. Actual first h=1 quotient and principal-open localization schemes empty; explicit second literal source-root-induced quotient/open/cone primepoints and actual second schemes nonempty. Actual first principal basic open empty/second basic open contains actual evaluated source point. Actual stalk length8 differs from the known one scheme point. All ring/localization facts and point populations credited predecessor facts, not new populations. No supplied stalk/localization compatibility, length, locality, residue or reducedness conclusion as premise. Four new modules(three concrete andone modern import-only adapter),24frozen local dependency modules/0copies/42oldformalconfigs/59oldformal-artifactpins checked before/after each numbered state. Established official comparison/affine reducedness/scalar length methods credited. Qualified Diem n!d^n with multiplicities unrefuted; ordinary cone not its product-projective instance. No general cycles/intersection/positive-dimensional isolated components/projective bound/RojasC refinement, no explicit localized-Spec/basic-open scheme isomorphism, no source second root uniqueness/wholecurve/order/scalar/decomposition claim. Defaultlimits/standardfoundations/no holes/customaxioms/nativeproofeval/raisedlimits/flags/waivers/frozenedits/cryptoPython/spend/upload. No new solver/cryptographic experiment/host/compiler independence/novelty/canonicalpromotion/full14 claim.",
